                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I searched for ages yesterday but couldn\u0027t find a single tiger.\n\nSo I asked a shop assistant where the tiger was. The assistant immediately replied, \"It\u0027s just over there. If it\u0027s not outside, it\u0027s resting inside. It won\u0027t come out on rainy days.\"\n\nIt seemed like they knew tigers very well.\n\nEven though I didn\u0027t see a tiger in the end, I was still happy.\n\nI\u0027ll go again next time to make friends!\n\nUntil then, I hope I don\u0027t get caught and made into a tiger-shaped bag! 🐯🐯",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "昨天找半天但一隻老虎都沒看到\n於是詢問商家店員老虎在哪裡\n店員馬上回答「在旁邊而已，如果不在外面就是在裡面休息，下雨天牠都不會出來」\n感覺跟老虎很熟\n雖然最後還是沒看到老虎還是很開心\n下次再去交朋友！\n在那之前希望不要被抓去做老虎包🐯🐯",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
